t px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit build</a><a class=\"rounded-lg border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:border-line/80 transition-colors\" href=\"/sign-in\">Sign in</a></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_45%_at_50%_0%,rgba(77,142,240,0.11)_0%,transparent_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-content px-6 pt-24 pb-20\"><div class=\"flex justify-center mb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/25 bg-accent/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse\"></span>Real-time price intelligence</span></div><h1 class=\"text-center text-5xl md:text-[66px] font-bold tracking-tight text-ink leading-[1.05] mb-6\">Never overpay for<br/><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-accent-hover bg-clip-text text-transparent\">PC components.</span></h1><p class=\"text-center text-lg text-ink-muted max-w-[520px] mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed\">ComponentWatch tracks prices across Newegg, Amazon, Best Buy, and eBay — updated every 30 minutes. Set a target and get alerted when it drops.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center mb-20\"><a class=\"rounded-xl bg-accent px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors text-center\" href=\"/compare\">Track a component</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface-alt transition-colors text-center\" href=\"/builds\">Browse SFF builds</a></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[480px]\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line/70 bg-surface/70 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(77,142,240,0.07)] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-4 border-b border-line\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink\">NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5\">Founders Edition · 24 GB GDDR6X</p></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide rounded-full bg-sff-green/10 text-sff-green px-2.5 py-0.5\">Tracking</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-line/40 last:border-0 hover:bg-surface-alt transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted w-24 shrink-0\">Amazon</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 ml-auto\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-sff-green tabular-nums\">↓ $50</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">$1,599</span><span class=\"hidden sm:block text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap text-sff-green bg-sff-green/10\">Best price</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-line/40 last:border-0 hover:bg-surface-alt transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted w-24 shrink-0\">Newegg</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 ml-auto\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">$1,649</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-line/40 last:border-0 hover:bg-surface-alt transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted w-24 shrink-0\">Best Buy</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 ml-auto\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">$1,699</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-line/40 last:border-0 hover:bg-surface-alt transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted w-24 shrink-0\">eBay</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 ml-auto\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-sff-green tabular-nums\">↓ $120</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums\">$1,529</span><span class=\"hidden sm:block text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap text-sff-amber bg-sff-amber/10\">New-in-box listing</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 bg-surface-alt\"><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">Updated 4 min ago · affiliate links</span><a class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors\" href=\"/compare\">Set price alert →</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/15 transition-colors\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 5h14M3 10h14M3 15h8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-2 text-sm\">Multi-retailer tracking</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Prices refresh every 30 minutes from Newegg, Amazon, Best Buy, and eBay. One dashboard, four storefronts — no tab-switching.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/15 transition-colors\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 2v4M10 14v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M12.24 12.24l2.83 2.83M2 10h4M14 10h4M4.93 15.07l2.83-2.83M12.24 7.76l2.83-2.83\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-2 text-sm\">Instant price alerts</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Set a target price for any component. The moment any tracked retailer drops below it, you get an email before inventory clears.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/15 transition-colors\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 7h6M7 10h4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-2 text-sm\">Community SFF builds</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Real builds physically assembled and benchmarked — thermal readings, Cinebench scores, and component prices. Not spec sheets.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-line/40\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 md:gap-14\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Tracked retailers</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted/60 hover:text-ink-muted transition-colors\">Newegg</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted/60 hover:text-ink-muted transition-colors\">Amazon</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted/60 hover:text-ink-muted transition-colors\">Best Buy</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted/60 hover:text-ink-muted transition-colors\">eBay</span></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-surface border-y border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-10\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-2\">Community</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink\">Real SFF builds, real data</h2><p class=\"te